<!-- ====== MANAGING IT ====== -->
<section class="cc-payoff">
  <div class="cc-payoff__container">
    <p class="cc-payoff__kicker">Managing it day to day</p>
    <h2 class="cc-payoff__eyebrow">Chronic skin conditions respond to consistent, Malassezia-safe routines. Here's how to build yours.</h2>
    <div class="cc-payoff__grid">
      <article class="cc-payoff__item">
        <div class="cc-payoff__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
            <rect x="17" y="8" width="30" height="48" rx="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6"/>
            <path d="M24 18h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M23 38l6-7 6 6 4-4 5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M32 50V39m0 0l-5 5m5-5l5 5" stroke="#c75b2a" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="cc-payoff__step" aria-label="Step 1">1</p>
        <h3 class="cc-payoff__title">Know what you're working with</h3>
        <p class="cc-payoff__desc">Learn how <em>Malassezia</em> behaves and why these conditions flare. Our free <a href="/pages/handbook">Malassezia Handbook</a> covers the science in plain language, and if you're unsure what you have, a dermatologist can confirm a diagnosis.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cc-payoff__item">
        <div class="cc-payoff__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
            <path d="M18 10h24l8 8v35H18V10z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M42 10v9h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M25 27h16M25 34h11" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M25 44l3.2 3.2 6.3-8.2" stroke="#d4952a" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="cc-payoff__step" aria-label="Step 2">2</p>
        <h3 class="cc-payoff__title">Audit what you're already using</h3>
        <p class="cc-payoff__desc">Many mainstream products contain oils and fatty acids <em>Malassezia</em> feeds on, so a routine can quietly work against you. Run your labels through our free <a href="/pages/ingredient-checker">Ingredient Checker</a> to spot ingredients that can make things worse.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="cc-payoff__item">
        <div class="cc-payoff__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none">
            <path d="M20 10h25l7 7v37H20V10z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M45 10v8h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            <path d="M27 28h16M27 36h18M27 44h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M22 54h30" stroke="#c75b2a" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M29 20h8m-4-4v8" stroke="#d4952a" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <p class="cc-payoff__step" aria-label="Step 3">3</p>
        <h3 class="cc-payoff__title">Keep it under control</h3>
        <p class="cc-payoff__desc">Fungal acne, seb derm, dandruff, and tinea versicolor can come back. A Malassezia-safe routine built on our collection of OTC solutions helps manage symptoms and keeps flares less frequent, so you're not starting over each time.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

